+# Billing disputes
+
+Billing questions are classified by `classifyBillingQuestion` in `/src/billing.ts`. A message containing the exact lowercase substring `refund` is classified as `refund-review`; every other message passed to the classifier is classified as `invoice-question`.
+
+The classifier only assigns one of those two categories. It does not approve refunds, resolve disputes, retrieve invoices, or provide invoice details.

